      "summary": "Repository-level agent contract for skills-ui defining architecture layout, SKILLS_UI_* environment variables, development commands, git worktree workflow, Linear planning rules, and documentation authority. Routes agents to domain, issue-tracker, and triage-label guidance under docs/agents/.",
