      "language": "markdown",
      "summary": "Canonical domain glossary for skills-ui establishing ubiquitous terminology across the WebUI and TUI surfaces. Defines layout containers (Frame, Filter List Panel, Detail Panel), Filter List Card anatomy, Skill Provenance, Post-Mutation Hook, and Health Pill along with terms to avoid.",
