      "language": "markdown",
      "summary": "Primary user and contributor documentation introducing skills-ui as a single-binary Bun wrapper for the skills CLI across OpenTUI, local WebUI, headless serve API, and hosted GitHub Pages modes. Details v0.5.3 performance benchmarks, checksum-verified curl installation via scripts/install.sh, CLI usage, development commands, and MIT licensing.",
