      "summary": "Milestone ledger and forward roadmap for skills-ui (versioned 0.x.y indefinitely), mirroring the canonical Linear Roadmap from v0.0.x through v0.5.5 and unversioned future goals. Records ratified Hosted UI decisions and guardrails, the v0.5.1-v0.5.3 hardening series, split-pane ergonomics, and hub integration milestones.",
